    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d88-a2">

                <pb facs="0203" n="99" xml:id="pg99"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure in J. S. Long’s letter.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Toriello to
                            Agent Pacific Mail Steamship
                    Company.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Port of San José</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1890-07-18"><hi rendition="#italic">July</hi> 18,
                        1890</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: In view of the instructions which I have
                    received, you can order the transshipment from the steamer <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Colima</hi> to the steamer <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Sydney</hi> of the 20 boxes of arms and 25 of cartridges which came from
                    San Francisco for the ports of the Republic of Salvador.</p>
                <p>I am, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">E. Toriello.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
